tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/677254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime","html_url":"https://github.com/goatchurchprime","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/goatchurchprime/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T17:26:40Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T17:26:40Z","body":"This changes (between v4.4.dev7 and v4.4.beta1) how `AudioStreamPlayer` with an `AudioStreamMicrophone` works because now if you call `play()` on an already playing microphone stream it completely breaks the input on Linux (\"ERROR: PulseAudio: pa_stream_disconnect error: Bad state\")\r\n\r\nThe problem does not materialize on Windows.\r\n\r\nIt's also okay (to call \"play()\" on a playing microphone stream) after this PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100508 because it counts the number of starts and stops applied by the different players to the singular microphone input stream. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613042635/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]